<\body>
  <math|n=<above|<below|<big|sum>|i=1>|m>a<rsub|i> 2<rsup|i-1>\<Rightarrow\><frac|n|2<rsup|m>>=a<rsub|m>+\<varepsilon\>,where \<varepsilon\>=<frac|<above|<below|<big|sum>|i=1>|m-1>a<rsub|i>\<times\>2<rsup|i-1>|2<rsup|m>>\<leqslant\><frac|2<rsup|m>-1|2<rsup|m>>\<less\>1. OBS a<rsub|m>=1,otherwise n=<above|<below|<big|sum>|i=1>|l>a<rsub|i> 2<rsup|i-1>,if a<rsub|m>,a<rsub|m-1>,\<ldots\>,a<rsub|l+1> are all 0\<Rightarrow\><frac|n|2<rsup|m>>=1+\<varepsilon\>\<Rightarrow\>m=<around*|\<lfloor\>|log<rsub|2><around*|(|n|)>|\<rfloor\>>.>
</body>

